# Shops: list, buy, sell and value. Purser (10, with 100 gold and 503 silver) leads; Pickpocket (13, haggle at 95%),
# Decimus (10, with no money; it sells the sword it wields), Unseen (5, invisible) and Seer (20, who carries an
# invisible ivory staff, 905) follow, from the temple through the bakery (3009, the baker buys nothing and can't see
# invisible people), the general store (3010, the grocer buys lights, treasure, trash, containers and food: 849
# silver's worth), the weapon shop (3011), the jeweller's (3034, gems are sold to be destroyed: no haggling) and the
# magic shop (3033: the wizard sees invisible things). Purser also has a strange amulet (307, no drop), a druish
# staff (308, trash), a gold nugget (917, worth more than the grocer has), a small pearl (3373), a lantern (3031,
# which the grocer stocks without limit) and two small wands (106), one with no maximum charge. Purser's pet fido
# can't carry what it buys.
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
